2. The following offences may be compounded, in accordance with section 69 of the Act, by the Executive Director or any officer authorised by him:
(a)any offence (other than a continuing offence) under section 28(2), 29(3), 33(6), 34(7), 37(6), 39(2), 40(3), 41(3), 43(6), 43A(3) or (4), 64(1)(a) or 65(4) or (5) of the Act;
[S 187/2023 wef 07/04/2023]
(b)any offence under regulation 5(3), 6(2), 7(3), 8(2) or 9(3) of the Estate Agents (Estate Agency Work) Regulations 2010 (G.N. No. S 644/2010);
[S 187/2023 wef 07/04/2023]
(c)any offence under regulation 17(3) of the Estate Agents (Disciplinary Proceedings) Regulations 2011 (G.N. No. S 152/2011);
[S 187/2023 wef 07/04/2023]
(d)any offence under rule 17(3) of the Estate Agents (Appeals) Rules 2010 (G.N. No. S 643/2010).
[S 187/2023 wef 07/04/2023]
